entry('inferior-parietal','Inferior parietal lobule',meshes('Supramarginal gyrus','Angular gyrus'),4,'Comprises supramarginal and angular gyri.',bullets=['Supramarginal gyrus caps the posterior lateral fissure.','Angular gyrus lies around the posterior end of the superior temporal sulcus.'],refs=['ut-parietal'])
