entry('cingulate','Cingulate gyrus',group('limbic'),5,'The lecture links this limbic-system region with emotion.',bullets=['Follow its arch above the corpus callosum.','The cingulate and callosal sulci are its key medial landmarks.'],view='medial',note='Some source parcels combine cingulate gyrus and sulcus. The names and parcel limits are retained rather than split by invented geometry.')
