entry('medial-y','Y-shaped medial sulci',meshes('Parieto-occipital sulcus','Calcarine sulcus'),5,'The lecture’s Y is formed by parieto-occipital, pre-calcarine and post-calcarine components.',bullets=['Identify the parieto-occipital limb and the calcarine course.','Use the original figure to distinguish the pre- and post-calcarine terminology.'],view='medial',note='The source contains one continuous calcarine mesh. Its subdivisions are not separate geometry.')
